@startuml Logout_Session_Revocation
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid

title Sequence: User Logout & Session Revocation

actor User
participant "Browser\n(auth.js)" as UI
participant "Express Server\n(server.js)" as Server
participant "Session Store" as SessionStore

User -> UI : Clicks [Log out] button
UI -> Server : GET /auth/logout
note over Server
  express-openid-connect
  middleware handles logout
end note

Server -> SessionStore : Invalidate session\n(delete from store)
note over SessionStore #c8f0c8
  ✓ Session deleted
end note

Server -> Server : Clear HTTP-only cookie\nSet-Cookie: auth0=; Max-Age=0
note over Server #c8f0c8
  ✓ Cookie expired
  Browser won't send it in future requests
end note

Server -> UI : 302 Redirect: Location: /
note over UI
  Frontend clears local auth state
end note

UI -> UI : Clear cached user data\nReset UI to anonymous state\nHide profile, show login button
UI -> User : "Logged out successfully"

User -> UI : Refresh page or try "Who am I?"
UI -> Server : GET /api/chat\n(no session cookie)
note over Server
  config: { authenticated: false, user: null }
end note

Server --> UI : Protected tool request\ntriggers auth signal again

@enduml
